<title>BULGARIA: BULGARIAN NATIONAL BANK FIXINGS FOR TUESDAY.</title>
<headline>BULGARIAN NATIONAL BANK FIXINGS FOR TUESDAY.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bulgarian National Bank set the following fixed exchange rates against the Bulgarian lev for Tuesday:</p>
<p>(Previous in brackets)</p>
<p>    USD  1,570.20 (1,594.80)	CHF  1,071.60 (1,111.10)</p>
<p>    DEM    919.86 (952.23)	  GBP  2,553.60 (2,611.30)</p>
<p>    ATS    130.99 (135.29)</p>
<p>Trading volume for Monday (total as dollar equivalent):</p>
<p>    Banks bought   $38.32 million</p>
<p>    Banks sold     $25.44 million</p>
<p>Total turnover $63.76 million ($31.48 million) -- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 981 8569; 981 4145</p>
